text": "Everyone turns.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Anyone.", "name": "HOLLIS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Nobody answers.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The line's gone dead.", "name": "KENJI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "All of them.", "name": "YASMIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "A door at the back swings open.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "REGIONAL VP DARIUS ACHTERBERG (60s, tailored suit, ghost-white skin) glides in and stops under the skeleton.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "He looks at each of them.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "His mouth is thin.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Who scared the callers away?", "name": "DARIUS", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Hollis lowers his pen.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Beatrix crosses herself.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Kenji, very slowly, raises a finger at the skeleton.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It was already like that.", "name": "KENJI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Darius studies the skeleton.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Then the pen in Hollis's hand.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Then the pen's bite marks.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Well done.", "name": "DARIUS", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "He leaves.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "The phones ring all at once.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}]}